    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in Mackintosh Park, this three-bedroom home presents an exciting opportunity for those looking to create their ideal family home. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation together with a large, west-facing rear garden, providing an excellent private outdoor space with plenty of scope to enjoy and enhance.\n\nThe house has massive potential and offers buyers the opportunity to modernise, reconfigure or extend the property, subject to the necessary planning permissions. Whether you're a first-time buyer, growing family or someone looking for a home with future potential, this property provides an excellent blank canvas in a sought-after residential setting.\n\nThe location is a major attraction, with the property situated adjacent to Clonkeen Park, offering wonderful access to green space, recreation and outdoor amenities. The area is particularly popular with families, with numerous sports clubs, leisure facilities and a wide selection of schools nearby, while the established community and excellent amenities make Mackintosh Park a superb place to call home.\n\nKey Features\n• 3-bedroom house\n• Large west-facing rear garden\n• Massive potential\n• Scope to modernise and extend, subject to planning\n• Adjacent to Clonkeen Park\n• Excellent choice of nearby schools\n• Numerous sports clubs and recreational facilities\n• Highly regarded family-friendly location\n• Fantastic opportunity to create a home to your own specification"
      },
